{"schemaVersion":1,"skill":{"id":"alirezarezvani--claude-skills--md-slides","name":"md-slides","description":"Converts a markdown deck (slides separated by `---` HR boundaries or by `# ` H1 headings, with optional `<!-- notes: ... -->` presenter notes blocks) into a single-file HTML presentation with arrow-key / space / PgDn / PgUp / Home / End / P / Esc keyboard navigation, presenter mode (split view with current slide + speaker notes + clock + next-slide preview), URL-hash deep linking, and `@media print` page-per-slide for PDF export. Triggers when the markdown-html-orchestrator classifies an input as SLIDES, or when invoked directly via /cs:md-slides. Reuses md-document's markdown parser for slide-body rendering and reads design-system tokens via config_loader.py. Refuses if input has no clear slide boundaries, produces a 1-slide deck, or `--strict-notes` is on with < 50% notes coverage. Use after orchestrator routing.","category":"Documents","tags":["md","slides","converts","markdown","deck","separated","by","hr","boundaries","h1","headings","optional","notes","...","presenter","blocks","into","single"],"repo":"alirezarezvani/claude-skills","owner":"alirezarezvani","stars":26382,"official":false,"featured":false,"license":"MIT","licensePath":"LICENSE","revision":"19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94","path":"markdown-html/skills/md-slides","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alirezarezvani/claude-skills/tree/19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94/markdown-html/skills/md-slides","checkedAt":"2026-09-24T09:18:44.317Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-26T13:53:02Z","fileCount":9,"bytes":62643,"sha256":"ac8d8c9b09b2ad72544412279d03673c36b6e2fee024ccddc9463272d62c46ab","historical":false},"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","sourcePath":"markdown-html/skills/md-slides/SKILL.md","bytes":6570,"sha256":"ac8d8c9b09b2ad72544412279d03673c36b6e2fee024ccddc9463272d62c46ab","mode":420,"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/alirezarezvani/claude-skills/19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f9